msgid "Known issues include:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Quarkus 3.2.11.Final, the eleventh maintenance release of the 3.2 LTS release train has been released."
msgstr ""

msgid "This release includes the following security-related fixes:"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-25710[CVE-2024-25710] Denial of service caused by an infinite loop for a corrupted DUMP file"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-1597[CVE-2024-1597] PostgreSQL JDBC Driver allows attacker to inject SQL if using PreferQueryMode=SIMPLE"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/cve-2024-1023[CVE-2024-1023] memory leak due to the use of Netty FastThreadLocal data structures in Vertx"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-1300[CVE-2024-1300] memory leak when a TCP server is configured with TLS and SNI support"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-1726[CVE-2024-1726] security checks for some inherited endpoints performed after serialization in RESTEasy Reactive may trigger a denial of service"
msgstr ""

msgid "And the following component upgrades:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Apache Commons Compress 1.25.0 -> 1.26.0"
msgstr ""

msgid "PostgeSQL JDBC Driver 42.6.0 -> 42.6.1"
msgstr ""

msgid "SmallRye JWT 4.3.0 -> 4.4.0"
msgstr ""

msgid "Vert.X 4.4.6 -> 4.4.8"
msgstr ""

msgid "If you are not already using a 3.2 release, please refer to https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.2[our migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "It should be a safe upgrade for anyone already using a 3.2.10.Final release."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr "Registro completo de cambios"

msgid "You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.2.11.Final[the full changelog of 3.2.11.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr "Únete a nosotros"

msgid "We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... Let's build something great together!"
msgstr "Valoramos mucho tus comentarios, así que por favor reporta errores, solicita mejoras... ¡Construyamos algo grandioso juntos!"

msgid "If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our welcoming community:"
msgstr "Si eres un usuario de Quarkus o simplemente tienes curiosidad, no seas tímido y únete a nuestra acogedora comunidad:"

msgid "provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr "proporcionar retroalimentación en https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"

msgid "craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr "escribir algo de código y enviar https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"

msgid "discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr "comentar con nosotros en https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] y en nuestra https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[lista de correo];"

msgid "ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr "hacer tus preguntas en https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
